cripts/2018/08/01/armstrong-world-industries-inc-awi-q2-2018-earning.aspx"},{"c":"AWI 2018 Q2","e":"awi","d":"2018-07-31","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Vic Grizzle","x":"We've largely completed our G&A restructuring, which along with our other restructuring activities will provide $9 million of cost tailwinds as we move into the second half of 2018.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/08/01/armstrong-world-industries-inc-awi-q2-2018-earning.aspx"},{"c":"AWI 2018 Q2","e":"awi","d":"2018-07-31","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Brian MacNeal","x":"So, what we said, for the full year it's going to be 10, 90 of that's in the back half, it's more than just SG&A just for clarity, as its total restructuring savings that it's both manufacturing and SG&A. Next year, we expect another 10 which will bring the full program to the high range of 20.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/08/01/armstrong-world-industries-inc-awi-q2-2018-earning.aspx"},{"c":"AWI 2018 Q4","e":"awi","d":"2019-02-25","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Vic Grizzle","x":"Again, volume growth primarily in Architectural Specialties, price realization greater than inflation, manufacturing productivity and contributions from WAVE were the drivers of higher earnings.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/25/armstrong-world-industries-inc-awi-q4-2018-earning.aspx"},{"c":"AWI 2018 Q4","e":"awi","d":"2019-02-25","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Brian Macneal","x":"Price realization was the biggest driver to improved EBITDA.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/25/armstrong-world-industries-inc-awi-q4-2018-earning.aspx"},{"c":"AWI 2018 Q4","e":"awi","d":"2019-02-25","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Vic Grizzle","x":"The restructuring savings created by these actions will continue to benefit us in the first half of 2019.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/25/armstrong-world-industries-inc-awi-q4-2018-earning.aspx"},{"c":"AWI 2018 Q4","e":"awi","d":"2019-02-25","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Brian Macneal","x":"Adjusted EBITDA will grow by more than 10% as the fall through of the sales growth is coupled with continued productivity gains, the second half of our restructuring savings, and earnings growth from WAVE.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/25/armstrong-world-industries-inc-awi-q4-2018-earning.aspx"},{"c":"AWI 2019 Q1","e":"awi","d":"2019-04-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Vic Grizzle","x":"So we pushed hard for price increases to make sure that we covered inflation in 2018, and we realized the majority of that actions in the second half.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/04/29/armstrong-world-industries-inc-awi-q1-2019-earning.aspx"},{"c":"AWI 2019 Q1","e":"awi","d":"2019-04-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Vic Grizzle","x":"However, we are starting to anniversary this -- the bulk of the price realization that happened last year which is in the second half of the year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/04/29/armstrong-world-industries-inc-awi-q1-2019-earning.aspx"},{"c":"AWI 2019 Q1","e":"awi","d":"2019-04-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Brian MacNeal","x":"SG&A costs were flat as restructuring savings were offset by inflation, investment in Architectural Specialties capabilities and the SG&A of our acquired companies.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/04/29/armstrong-world-industries-inc-awi-q1-2019-earning.aspx"},{"c":"AWI 2019 Q1","e":"awi","d":"2019-04-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Brian MacNeal","x":"SG&A expenses were lower as a result of our right-sizing actions in 2018.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/04/29/armstrong-world-industries-inc-awi-q1-2019-earning.aspx"},{"c":"AWI 2019 Q1","e":"awi","d":"2019-04-29","l":"guidance","r":"analyst","s":"Michael Wood","x":"I'm curious what the other side of it is that you maintain guidance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/04/29/armstrong-world-industries-inc-awi-q1-2019-earning.aspx"},{"c":"AWI 2019 Q2","e":"awi","d":"2019-07-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Vic Grizzle","x":"As we talked about in the first quarter, we're lapping some of the aggressive price increases we were doing based on the inflationary environment last year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/29/armstrong-world-industries-inc-awi-q2-2019-earning.aspx"},{"c":"AWI 2019 Q2","e":"awi","d":"2019-07-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Vic Grizzle","x":"As you know, we were going heavier with our price increases in the second quarter last year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/29/armstrong-world-industries-inc-awi-q2-2019-earning.aspx"},{"c":"AWI 2019 Q2","e":"awi","d":"2019-07-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Brian MacNeal","x":"SG&A costs were slightly favorable as our 2018 restructuring efforts overcame inflation, investments in AS and the SG&A of our acquired companies.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/29/armstrong-world-industries-inc-awi-q2-2019-earning.aspx"},{"c":"AWI 2019 Q2","e":"awi","d":"2019-07-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Brian MacNeal","x":"SG&A expenses were lower as a result of our cost saving initiatives in 2018, and as you will remember, we announced the $20 million restructuring program in the second quarter of 2018 to right size our SG&A structure and optimize our manufacturing and distribution for our America's only business.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/29/armstrong-world-industries-inc-awi-q2-2019-earning.aspx"},{"c":"AWI 2019 Q3","e":"awi","d":"2019-10-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Victor D. Grizzle","x":"As we previewed with you, price realization in the quarter continue to normalize from the higher increases we reported earlier in the year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/28/armstrong-world-industries-inc-awi-q3-2019-earning.aspx"},{"c":"AWI 2019 Q3","e":"awi","d":"2019-10-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Victor D. Grizzle","x":"In the quarter, price increases once again outpaced input costs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/28/armstrong-world-industries-inc-awi-q3-2019-earning.aspx"},{"c":"AWI 2019 Q3","e":"awi","d":"2019-10-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Brian MacNeal","x":"SG&A expenses were also lower in the quarter even as we've now lapped our cost saving initiatives in 2018.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/28/armstrong-world-industries-inc-awi-q3-2019-earning.aspx"},{"c":"AWI 2019 Q3","e":"awi","d":"2019-10-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Brian MacNeal","x":"I'll remind you that manufacturing and SG&A, both benefited from the restructuring actions we took in the middle of 2018.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/28/armstrong-world-industries-inc-awi-q3-2019-earning.aspx"},{"c":"AWI 2019 Q4","e":"awi","d":"2020-02-24","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Victor D. Grizzle","x":"This makes us an America's-only business with minimal exposure to tariffs or the impact of the coronavirus.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/24/armstrong-world-industries-inc-awi-q4-2019-earning.aspx"},{"c":"AWI 2019 Q4","e":"awi","d":"2020-02-24","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Victor D. Grizzle","x":"Consistent with our third quarter results and our outlook, price realization continued to normalize from the high increases we reported in the first half of the year, which was driven by strong price realization carried over from a more inflationary 2018.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/24/armstrong-world-industries-inc-awi-q4-2019-earning.aspx"},{"c":"AWI 2020 Q1","e":"awi","d":"2020-04-27","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"John Lovallo","x":"We are still able to put through two price increases a year with, call it, 3%-ish realization.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/27/armstrong-world-industries-inc-awi-q1-2020-earning.aspx"},{"c":"AWI 2020 Q1","e":"awi","d":"2020-04-27","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Philip Ng","x":"But curious, what type of traction you saw on your price increase that you typically go out with on Mineral Fiber earlier in the year and how perhaps AUV might be tracking in April?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/27/armstrong-world-industries-inc-awi-q1-2020-earning.aspx"},{"c":"AWI 2020 Q2","e":"awi","d":"2020-07-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Vic Grizzle","x":"On pricing, we're still getting good traction on our February price increase and -- in the significant deflationary environment we're on -- we're in.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/28/armstrong-world-industries-inc-awi-q2-2020-earning.aspx"},{"c":"AWI 2020 Q2","e":"awi","d":"2020-07-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Vic Grizzle","x":"We're not likely to go out with a general price increase in August, but use the pricing tools that we have in our toolbox for more surgical pricing opportunities.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/28/armstrong-world-industries-inc-awi-q2-2020-earning.aspx"},{"c":"AWI 2020 Q2","e":"awi","d":"2020-07-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Brian MacNeal","x":"I will address our cost reduction initiatives in more detail when I review our 2020 outlook.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/28/armstrong-world-industries-inc-awi-q2-2020-earning.aspx"},{"c":"AWI 2020 Q2","e":"awi","d":"2020-07-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Brian MacNeal","x":"These cost reduction actions, coupled with our reduction of capital expenditures to a range of $50 million to $55 million, will drive a strong adjusted free cash flow margin of 22% to 25%.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/28/armstrong-world-industries-inc-awi-q2-2020-earning.aspx"},{"c":"AWI 2020 Q3","e":"awi","d":"2020-10-27","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Vic Grizzle","x":"Like-for-like pricing as you noted was positive as -- we implemented a February price increase and we've executed on that.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/27/armstrong-world-industries-inc-awi-q3-2020-earning/"},{"c":"AWI 2020 Q3","e":"awi","d":"2020-10-27","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jeffrey Stevenson","x":"My first one is just I wondered if you could talk about the December grid price increase and the motivations the industry had to move ahead with an increase before year-end?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/27/armstrong-world-industries-inc-awi-q3-2020-earning/"},{"c":"AWI 2020 Q3","e":"awi","d":"2020-10-27","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Brian MacNeal","x":"Continued manufacturing productivity and cost reduction initiatives, lower raw material and energy costs, and SG&A cost management were all positive in the quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/27/armstrong-world-industries-inc-awi-q3-2020-earning/"},{"c":"AWI 2020 Q3","e":"awi","d":"2020-10-27","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Vic Grizzle","x":"So again, we run this business to rightsize it relative to the conditions that we're in.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/27/armstrong-world-industries-inc-awi-q3-2020-earning/"},{"c":"AWI 2020 Q4","e":"awi","d":"2021-02-23","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Victor D. Grizzle","x":"We raised price in December as a result of that.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/23/armstrong-world-industries-inc-awi-q4-2020-earning/"},{"c":"AWI 2020 Q4","e":"awi","d":"2021-02-23","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Victor D. Grizzle","x":"We raised price again in January and again in February to stay ahead of the meaningful inflation that we're seeing there.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/23/armstrong-world-industries-inc-awi-q4-2020-earning/"},{"c":"AWI 2020 Q4","e":"awi","d":"2021-02-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Victor D. Grizzle","x":"We identified and acted on $40 million of temporary cost savings that would not impact our growth and value creation opportunities.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/23/armstrong-world-industries-inc-awi-q4-2020-earning/"},{"c":"AWI 2020 Q4","e":"awi","d":"2021-02-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Brian L. MacNeal","x":"In the quarter, continued manufacturing productivity, our cost reduction initiatives and lower raw material and energy costs aided profitability.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/23/armstrong-world-industries-inc-awi-q4-2020-earning/"},{"c":"AWI 2021 Q1","e":"awi","d":"2021-04-27","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Vic Grizzle","x":"As a result, beginning back in December, we have implemented five price increases totaling more than 40%.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/27/armstrong-world-industries-inc-awi-q1-2021-earning/"},{"c":"AWI 2021 Q1","e":"awi","d":"2021-04-27","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Vic Grizzle","x":"As a result, we have announced a heavier-than-normal 10% price increase on Mineral Fiber products and pulled the effective date up to May, earlier than normal.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/27/armstrong-world-industries-inc-awi-q1-2021-earning/"},{"c":"AWI 2021 Q2","e":"awi","d":"2021-07-27","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Victor D. Grizzle","x":"When we had again some rapid inflation based on the steel tariffs and being particular.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/27/armstrong-world-industries-inc-awi-q1-2021-earning/"},{"c":"AWI 2021 Q2","e":"awi","d":"2021-07-27","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Victor D. Grizzle","x":"As we expect inflation to persist, we have announced our third price increase this year effective mid-August.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/27/armstrong-world-industries-inc-awi-q1-2021-earning/"},{"c":"AWI 2021 Q2","e":"awi","d":"2021-07-27","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Victor D. Grizzle","x":"AUV in total was an outstanding highlight in the quarter with significant mix improvements to go along with the strong like-for-like price realization.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/27/armstrong-world-industries-inc-awi-q1-2021-earning/"},{"c":"AWI 2021 Q2","e":"awi","d":"2021-07-27","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Victor D. Grizzle","x":"On the strength of these results and the expected continuation of the market recovery in the back half of the year, we have updated and increased our 2021 guidance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/27/armstrong-world-industries-inc-awi-q1-2021-earning/"},{"c":"AWI 2021 Q2","e":"awi","d":"2021-07-27","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Brian MacNeal","x":"We are increasing our guidance ranges for all of our key metrics, and now expect year-over-year revenue growth of 16% to 18% adjusted EBITDA growth of 12% to 15%, adjusted EPS growth of 12% to 18%.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/27/armstrong-world-industries-inc-awi-q1-2021-earning/"},{"c":"AWI 2021 Q3","e":"awi","d":"2021-10-26","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Vic Grizzle","x":"We recognize this is unique and it's a testament to the strength of our industry-leading service model and the high-quality innovative products we manufacture that allows us to earn those price increases in the marketplace.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/26/armstrong-world-industries-inc-awi-q3-2021-earning/"},{"c":"AWI 2021 Q3","e":"awi","d":"2021-10-26","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Vic Grizzle","x":"We've also successfully introduced price increases for these products and that is helping address some of the inflationary pressures on this segment as well.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/26/armstrong-world-industries-inc-awi-q3-2021-earning/"},{"c":"AWI 2021 Q3","e":"awi","d":"2021-10-26","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Vic Grizzle","x":"And you'll remember, because you know as well that, in '18 and '19, 2018 and '19, we were rightsizing the organization to become an Americas only focused company.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/26/armstrong-world-industries-inc-awi-q3-2021-earning/"},{"c":"AWI 2024 Q3","e":"awi","d":"2024-10-29","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Vic Grizzle","x":"Now one driver is the rapid expansion of data centers and the increasing adoption of AI technologies, both of which are pressuring the U.S. electrical grid.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/14/armstrong-awi-q3-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AWI 2024 Q3","e":"awi","d":"2024-10-29","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Vic Grizzle","x":"So addressing the energy demands of buildings is a critical area of focus in order to lower the strain on the grid, while redirecting energy to support newer applications like data centers and AI.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/14/armstrong-awi-q3-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AWI 2024 Q3","e":"awi","d":"2024-10-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Vic Grizzle","x":"These strong results were driven by contributions from our recent Architectural Specialty acquisitions of 3form and BOK Modern, both of which are performing very well, along with solid AUV performance and specifically like-for-like price realization in our Mineral Fiber segment.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/14/armstrong-awi-q3-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AWI 2024 Q3","e":"awi","d":"2024-10-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Vic Grizzle","x":"Yes, we've had some nice realization really both in our February and our August price increases throughout the year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/14/armstrong-awi-q3-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AWI 2024 Q3","e":"awi","d":"2024-10-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Vic Grizzle","x":"Our TEMPLOK energy saving ceiling products provide up to 15% reduction in energy usage for heating and cooling of buildings, which is a significant cost saving for building operators.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/14/armstrong-awi-q3-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AWI 2024 Q3","e":"awi","d":"2024-10-29","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Chris Calzaretta","x":"With strong profitability in the third quarter and our improved profitability outlook for the remainder of the year, we are increasing our guidance for adjusted EBITDA, and adjusted diluted net earnings per share, as well as modestly increasing our guidance for adjusted free cash flow.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/14/armstrong-awi-q3-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AWI 2025 Q3","e":"awi","d":"2025-10-28","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Victor D. Grizzle","x":"As the impact of more significant tariffs increased the level of uncertainty which led us to modestly adjust our volume outlook for the back half of the year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/28/armstrong-awi-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AWI 2025 Q3","e":"awi","d":"2025-10-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Victor D. Grizzle","x":"And the building blocks of that again is really making sure we're getting good price realization, to more than offset inflation in the marketplace, which we're continuing to do very well.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/28/armstrong-awi-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AWI 2025 Q3","e":"awi","d":"2025-10-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Adam Baumgarten","x":"And then if we think about the August price increase starting to flow through, should you see some level of year-over-year AUV improvement in the fourth quarter?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/28/armstrong-awi-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AWI 2025 Q3","e":"awi","d":"2025-10-28","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Christopher P. Calzaretta","x":"With strong year-to-date net sales and adjusted EBITDA growth, and stabilizing market conditions, we are raising our full-year guidance across all key metrics.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/28/armstrong-awi-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AWI 2025 Q4","e":"awi","d":"2026-02-24","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Mark Hershey","x":"And second, the rapid global build out of data centers driven by cloud computing and AI.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/24/armstrong-awi-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AWI 2025 Q4","e":"awi","d":"2026-02-24","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Tomohiko Sano","x":"So my question is, for the 6% AUV growth in 2026, what is the price and mix split, and how sustainable is the pricing power in the current competitive environment, and what the customer is saying about the price per value delivered, please?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/24/armstrong-awi-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"AWI 2026 Q1","e":"awi","d":"2026-04-28","l":"ai_spend","r":"analyst","s":"Mark Hershey","x":"Our confidence in this outlook is bolstered by the urgent need for energy efficiency and grid stability as demands from AI, cloud computing, and data centers pressure grid systems.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/28/armstrong-awi-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"AWI 2026 Q1","e":"awi","d":"2026-04-28","l":"ai_spend","r":"analyst","s":"Phil Ng","x":"Some of these growth factors you've called out—whether it's transportation, particularly in AI/data centers—and then TempLock would be a little different approach, more smaller customer base.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/28/armstrong-awi-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"AWI 2026 Q1","e":"awi","d":"2026-04-28","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Chris Calzaretta","x":"This decrease was primarily driven by higher manufacturing costs, which included a $2 million nonrecurring tariff adjustment, an incremental $2 million of costs of recent acquisitions, and approximately $1 million related to plant investments to support growth.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/28/armstrong-awi-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"AWI 2026 Q1","e":"awi","d":"2026-04-28","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Chris Calzaretta","x":"…AS adjusted EBITDA declined by 9% year over year, primarily driven by the nonrecurring $2 million tariff-related adjustment previously noted along with a total of $3 million of both higher selling expenses and manufacturing investments to support growth, all of which pressured segment operating…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/28/armstrong-awi-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"AWI 2026 Q1","e":"awi","d":"2026-04-28","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Chris Calzaretta","x":"We are reaffirming our full-year guidance for net sales, adjusted EBITDA, and adjusted free cash flow.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/28/armstrong-awi-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"AWI 2026 Q3","e":"awi","d":"2026-10-27","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Mark Hershey","x":"Most notably in Canada,